Dear Lisa van Wyk,

Welcome to the October 2026 edition of the Bushveld Timber customer newsletter.

We appreciate the support from workshops such as Jacaranda Panel Beaters and we enjoy sharing practical updates each month.

Product news this month focuses on our pine shelving boards and exterior varnished meranti doors, both now available in a wider range of lengths for spring projects.

We have also restocked galvanised screws, sandpaper packs and wood filler for general maintenance work.

Seasonal tip for October is to lightly sand and reseal outdoor benches and entrance doors before the summer rains arrive, as this helps prevent swelling and fading.

Store offcuts under cover to keep them dry and easy to reuse.

Thank you for reading and please share your feedback on what you would like us to cover next month.

If you no longer wish to receive this newsletter, please reply to this email with the word unsubscribe and we will remove you promptly.

Kind regards
Marike Botha
Bushveld Timber
